msgstr "کاربرد: rubrapack inspect <file.msi> [table|--summary|--files|--streams] | inspect <file.msix|file.msixbundle> [--files|--manifest] | inspect <file.mst|file.msp> --base <base.msi> | inspect <file.cab>"

